positive eigenvalue of -L, where

    Lf(v)=m(v)^{-1}sum_{nonloop e=vw}R_e^{-1}(f(w)-f(v)).

The speed measure is the **original degree**, not the sum of conductances.
This distinction is part of the fixed model.

