Let T be the unconditioned Galton--Watson tree with this law. Then the
proposed theorem is, for every x>0, through **all positive integer n**,

    P(n^{-1/alpha}tau_n <= x)
        -> exp(-K(q,alpha)x^{-alpha}),
    K(q,alpha)=p_2 E|T|^alpha in (0,infinity).             (F)

